OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of poppies bloom along
OL,4,Acharity trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "poppy army" wielding crochet hooks
OL,7,Fand knitting needles has led a friendly
OL,8,Finvasion by covering a town and
OL,9,Fsurrounding villages in 18,000 of the
OL,10,Fsymbolic flowers.
OL,12,FRed and purple woollen poppies have
OL,13,Fbloomed on a charity trail across
OL,14,FWoburn Sands and surrounding villages
OL,15,Fon the Buckinghamshire and Bedfordshire
OL,16,Fborder, ahead of Remembrance Sunday.
OL,18,FThe display, featuring silhouettes of
OL,19,Fthree soldiers approaching a horse in a
OL,20,Ffield of poppies, started to blossom
OL,21,Fwhen a group appealed for people's
OL,22,Fcreations.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
