OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of poppies bloom along
OL,4,Acharity trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FLorraine Hearn, of Woburn Sands Poppy
OL,7,FArmy, said: "It's been a really, really
OL,8,Fincredible thing, and I think one of
OL,9,Fthe most important things of all, it's
OL,10,Fbrought people together."
